          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yasibona ukuthi uLeya wayezondwa, yavula isizalo sakhe, kodwa uRaheli wayeyinyumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ULeya wathatha isisu, wazala indodana, wayitha ibizo wathi nguRubeni, ngoba wathi: INkosi ibonile inhlupheko yami; khathesi indoda yami izakungithanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabuya wathatha isisu, wazala indodana, wathi: Njengoba iNkosi izwile ukuthi ngiyazondwa, inginike lalindodana; wayitha ibizo wathi nguSimeyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabuya wakhulelwa, wazala indodana; wathi: Ngalesisikhathi indoda yami izanamathela kimi, ngoba ngiyizalele amadodana amathathu; ngalokhu yabizwa ngokuthi nguLevi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waphinda wakhulelwa, wazala indodana; wathi: Ngalesisikhathi sengizakuyidumisa iNkosi; ngakho wayitha ibizo wathi nguJuda; wasesima ukuzala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.29.35",
